# Ollama Chatbot

Full-stack chatbot application with a React frontend and FastAPI backend, powered by Ollama for local LLM inference.

## Tech Stack

### Backend
- FastAPI
- MongoDB (conversation and user storage)
- Redis (conversation context caching)
- Ollama (local LLM inference)
- JWT authentication (PyJWT + bcrypt)
- Pydantic (request/response validation)

### Frontend
- React 18 + Vite
- React Router (client-side routing)
- Formik + Yup (form management and validation)
- Axios (HTTP client with token interceptor)
- Context API (authentication state management)

